# Family Financial Operating System

Family mode is a **household coordination OS**, not budgeting or accounting.

## Build for

- Responsibility, contribution, sacrifice, pressure, dependency
- Warm, calm, emotionally intelligent copy
- Engine-driven graphs (members → obligations → forecasts → insights)

## Do NOT build

- Spreadsheet layouts, generic fintech cards, transaction-first UX
- Single-person framing when `isSalariedFamily(settings)` (see `family-mode-copy.mdc`)
- Hardcoded insight `text` in engines — use `{ id, tone, params? }` + `insight.{id}` in `en.js`

## Adding family intelligence

1. Logic → new function in `src/engines/family*.js` or extend `familyCommandCenter.js`
2. Unit test in `src/engines/__tests__/`
3. Wire via `useFamilyCommandIntel` or `useStabilityIntel` — not raw engine calls in JSX
4. UI → `HouseholdCommandPanel` (Analytics full house) or `HomeOverviewCard` badge (Home glance) or `FamilyModeDashboard` (Analytics depth)
5. Dependents edit → `HouseholdDependentsEditorModal` + `HouseholdFamilyBadge` (count + pencil)
6. Register engine in `src/governance/registries/modes.js` if new file
7. `npm run audit:household` + `npm run audit:insight-registry`

## Long-term north star

“Google Photos for family financial life” — contribution history, household coordination, emotional memory.

See `docs/architecture/FamilyOperatingSystem.md` for phase roadmap.
